  "caveats": [
    "Fire is often human-set (agricultural burning); recurrence reflects practice, not hazard.",
    "Cells with no fire history get low probability by design; new fire locations are not predictable here.",
    "Latest 2026-12 uses 2026-11 month-to-date (partial) and 2026-08..10 NRT months as lag features.",
    "Korea: 16 of the top-20 2026-12 cells and 4 of 10 recurrent sites contain static industrial heat sources (static_source_cells_0.01deg). Without those cells KR PR-AUC is 0.158 (model) vs 0.132 (recurrence rate). Use has_static_source to hide or label them."
